hpcups-macos
============

The code under src/hpcups/ and src/common/ is taken from HPLIP 3.25.2 and
keeps its original license headers. HPLIP is distributed under a mix of
GPL v2, MIT and BSD licenses; the header of each file says which one
applies to it. The text HP ships in the HPLIP tarball is in COPYING.

The files added by this project (Makefile, scripts/, src/compat/, ppd/
changes, README.md) are licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 2 or (at your option) any later version, so the combined work can
be distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later terms. The PPD is derived from the
HPLIP PPD for the DeskJet 2300 series and carries HP's copyright.

Binaries link libjpeg-turbo statically (IJG and BSD-3-Clause licenses; its
notices are in its own LICENSE.md and README.ijg).
